WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Two friends.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.520
The same awful week: a
deadline, an argument,

3
00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.460
rain every day.

4
00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.680
For one, the low mood fades in a few days.

5
00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:13.060
Back with friends, sleeping fine.

6
00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.350
For the other, it doesn't lift.

7
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.260
Weeks pass.

8
00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:20.950
They stop going out, sleep
badly, and fall behind at school.

9
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.910
So where's the line between a bad
week and a mental health problem?

10
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.500
And who draws it?

11
00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:29.850
In this mission, you'll see
that we all have mental health,

12
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.240
and bad days are normal for everyone.

13
00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:35.890
You'll find out how a significant
problem can affect relationships,

14
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:40.230
everyday life and physical
wellbeing, and society too.

15
00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:43.520
Your mission: work out
where a bad week ends,

16
00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:44.830
and who decides.
